Anti Social
===========


§ 1  Interpretation

The following are taken as given:

1. Person.

2. Is authorised.

3. Receiver.

4. Is an individual aged 16 or over.

5. Is a body.

6. Effect.

7. Effect Target.

8. Is detrimental.

9. Is of a persistent or continuing nature.

10. Affects the quality of life of those in the locality.

11. Conduct.

12. Conduct.

13. Effect.

14. Is unreasonable.


§ 2  Provisions

1. May issue a community protection notice if:
    (a) is authorised with the person;
    (b) any of the following:
        (i) is an individual aged 16 or over the receiver; or
        (ii) is a body with the receiver;
    (c) is detrimental with the effect;
    (d) is of a persistent or continuing nature with the effect;
    (e) affects the quality of life of those in the locality with the effect; and
    (f) is unreasonable with the conduct.
    where:
    - The conduct means conduct with the receiver.
    - The effect means effect with the conduct.


Coverage
